<title>USA: HRE Properties Inc Q2 net and share rise.</title>
<headline>HRE Properties Inc Q2 net and share rise.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months Ended  Three Months Ended</p>
<p>					  April 30,	   April 30,</p>
<p>				     1997    1996	 1997    1996</p>
<p>				   (In thousands, except per share</p>
<p>data)</p>
<p>Revenues			 $13,871  $12,231    $5,165  $6,077</p>
<p>Operating income		 5,690    1,693     1,180     916</p>
<p>Gains on sales of properties	-   6,252	   -	 -</p>
<p>Net income			 5,690    7,945     1,180     916</p>
<p>Funds from operations(a)     4,966    4,570     2,503   2,278</p>
<p>Per common share data:</p>
<p>Net income			 $1.12    $1.48     $0.23   $0.17</p>
<p>Funds from operations(a)     $0.97    $0.85     $0.49   $0.42</p>
<p>Dividends paid		   $0.62    $0.60     $0.32   $0.31</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p> shares outstanding	    5,098    5,370     5,097   5,372</p>
<p>NOTES: (a) Defined as net income excluding gains (or losses) on sales of properties, plus depreciation and amortization and the elimination of significant non-recurring charges and credits.</p>
<p>Decrease in weighted average shares outstanding in the quarter and half results from formation of a joint venture early in the fiscal year in which the corporation repurchased 272,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>1997 six month earnings also include additional percentage rental of $3.25 million from a tenant in a settlement of disputed amounts under a lease.</p>
<p>1996 net income included gains on sales of properties of $6,252,000 or $1.16 a share.</p>
</text>
